     "body": "<p>that was more involved than I expected since I needed to update multiple pages, but i've added documentation for jetty 12 to:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/F7D/Deployment\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/F7D/Deployment</a> <br/>\nI also updated the following pages to reflect jetty 12<br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/F7D/Application+Configuration\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/F7D/Application+Configuration</a> <br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/F7D/System+Requirements\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/F7D/System+Requirements</a> <br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/F7D/Servlet+Container+Authentication+Configuration\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/F7D/Servlet+Container+Authentication+Configuration</a> <br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/F7D/Disable+Authentication+and+Authorization\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/F7D/Disable+Authentication+and+Authorization</a> <br/>\nI tested out the deployment steps with auth turned on and off</p>",
